      {
        "locator": "Section 3.1.3 Scoring, alcohol paragraph",
        "quote": "For adults of legal drinking age, 25 g/day (men) and 15 g/day (women) are selected as the standard for the score of 5, and 60 g/day (men) and 40 g/day (women) are chosen as the standard for the score of zero.",
